  "ingredients": [
    "4 tablespoons butter, divided",
    "1 medium onion, diced",
    "2 teaspoons white sugar",
    "1 pound calves' livers",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HxWJjqZPioxZwO5b2pubgoFtwNY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14673-liver-onions-ingredients-0259-d4e4ec5759064974aca96f7079829062.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14673/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 3 tablespoons butter in a medium skillet over medium heat. Add onion and sauté until soft, about 5 minutes. Stir in sugar, reduce the heat to low, and continue to cook and stir until onion is very tender and brown, about 25 to 30 minutes; transfer onions into a small bowl and reserve skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/haKWYer6u7K_p7Y9vHUNYptgKOQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/LiverOnion_14673_step2_0265-f5ddbf5404e641f7bcd519719cf9954e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14673/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the onions are cooking, rinse liver and remove the thin outer membrane. Slice liver into 1/4- to 1/2-inch-thick slices.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CPkDtbyUr67g8mUnwPEynM2eykw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/LiverOnion_14673_step3_0266-c30f28fe4e45471390f78feb488f9739.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14673/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dredge liver in flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2o_kHklG-Rz5LLcHwB4FgkH21co=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/LiverOnion_14673_step4_0267-22ed2d8293e94a6fab51d1dd156755cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14673/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat remaining 1 tablespoon butter in the same skillet over medium heat. Add liver and cook until browned, 1 to 1 1/2 minutes per side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fhUWroKrWdP_o-LuhxuoC5GDQ04=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/LiverOnion_14673_step5_0270-491aa61f53ba41eb969adab82abed069.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14673/step_05.webp"
